{"3644930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MEATHOOK", "steam_appid": 3644930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4808380], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Demo includes 7/10 levels. Give it a try!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious cult has captured you. You're suspended from a conveyor mechanism and forced to partake in a collection of ritualistic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a tactile physics-driven weapon system with a unique manual reload feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.poster.avif?t=1784653757\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.webm?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.mp4?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate small interconnected levels by selecting markers to move towards. Discover new paths and unlock shortcuts. Optimize your strategy by exploring and replaying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.poster.avif?t=1784653757\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.webm?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.mp4?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect useful resources like food, ammo, keys and guns. Completionists also have secret items to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.poster.avif?t=1784653757\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.webm?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.mp4?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a new mystery in the surreal world of my first game, Barbotine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleanse the tunnels of cultists.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the tunnels and escape with your life?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Demo includes 7/10 levels. Give it a try!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious cult has captured you. You're suspended from a conveyor mechanism and forced to partake in a collection of ritualistic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a tactile physics-driven weapon system with a unique manual reload feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.poster.avif?t=1784653757\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.webm?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/d06a229023eb5b66c377dc464e40c987.mp4?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate small interconnected levels by selecting markers to move towards. Discover new paths and unlock shortcuts. Optimize your strategy by exploring and replaying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.poster.avif?t=1784653757\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.webm?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/7553fb2c6b6cdbf123443b17f3f70a4a.mp4?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect useful resources like food, ammo, keys and guns. Completionists also have secret items to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.poster.avif?t=1784653757\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.webm?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/extras/0637ab5cbff21637f3ab009d1a7303d4.mp4?t=1784653757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a new mystery in the surreal world of my first game, Barbotine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleanse the tunnels of cultists.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the tunnels and escape with your life?</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Survival horror FPS with a physics-driven weapon system. You are bound to a sinister conveyor mechanism. Reach for weapons and items, navigate labyrinthine tunnels, and blast your path to worthiness!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/85fa9bc94a7dd44a1330c4823960fd20cec3c053/header.jpg?t=1784653757", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/fad26a5f2d4cd8a958f91c880f6e7cea9ade523a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784653757", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644930/fad26a5f2d4cd8a958f91c880f6e7cea9ade523a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784653757", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4702MQ CPU @ 2.20GHz 2.19 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</st